 bangladesh:['Flooding leaves salt marks in soil after rooms can be cleaned; recovery times differ by asset.','Fishing and sewing stop while food, school expenses and debt repayments continue.','Water queues and transport compete with sewing; a daughter shares care work and misses lessons.','Loudspeaker and phone warnings are translated into timing and route decisions; informal cooking groups include newcomers.','Wet documents create assistance barriers; accessible shelter and public road maintenance are priorities.','Temporary educational mobility is negotiated with elder care and two sets of expenses.'],
